<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Alex. Brown on electronics makers.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Alex. Brown on electronics makers.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said analyst Jim Savage has initiated coverage of stocks in the electronics manufacturing sector.</p>
<p>-- It started SCI Systems Inc, Jabil Circuit Inc, and Hadco Corp as strong buys.</p>
<p>-- It initiated Solectron Corp, Elamex SA de CV, Altron Inc, DII Group Inc as buys.</p>
<p>-- It started Merix Corp, Flextronics International Ltd, Kent Electronics Corp, Sanmina Corp as neutrals.</p>
</text>
